  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eliminating Blinding Trachoma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the global effort to eliminate blinding trachoma. The UK is providing &#xa3;50m over 5 years to support the implementation of Surgery, Antibiotics, Facial Cleanliness and Environment improvements (SAFE) activities to prevent , control and treat trachoma in a number of high-burden countries in Sub-Saharan Africa, with up to 455,000 people receiving surgical procedures to prevent blindness and up to 22m people protected from blinding trachoma through antibiotic distribution</narrative>
  </description>
